---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="404 迷路了 — QmoStudio">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 pt-24 pb-8 text-center">
    <span class="wiggle inline-block text-8xl">🗺️</span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-extrabold">404</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
      糟糕，這一頁還不存在！ <span class="text-ink/50">Page not found.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/70">也許它還在醞釀中，先回遊樂場逛逛吧。</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn-pop mt-8 bg-coral text-white">🏠 回首頁</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
